    "summary": "gather.relationCall for quality and adherence (adapters/code-review-gather.ts; each spec's chunk.relation gives its rules): a cut 'calls' relation is judged once, both full rows in one call when they fit, else (or within a refused size) two calls, each one full row against the other's neighbour summary; non-call cut relations get no call. The judgement asks for today's findings shape located in the caller's file (adherence also sees the approved clauses and tasks). gather.validate rejects findings located outside the two symbols' files or naming a counterpart that is neither, with fixed-size reasons; the re-issue carries them and a second failure fails the review.",
